WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:06.673
[dramatic music building]

00:01:27.454 --> 00:01:28.621
REPORTER: This
small American group

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:31.324
includes a teacher,
a nurse, a recording

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:33.293
engineer, and a photographer.

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:36.062
10 years ago they might have
stuck to smoking marijuana.

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:39.165
But now they pass around
the lines on the mirror.

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:41.067
MAN: Save some for
the rest of us.

00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:43.937
[laughter]

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:53.179
His structure is based
on two foundations.

00:01:53.246 --> 00:01:58.017
One is extreme violence
and the other is business

00:01:58.084 --> 00:02:00.186
and logistical organization.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:10.163
His capacity for violence,
his ambition and his smarts

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:11.530
single him out.

00:02:11.598 --> 00:02:14.267
And no one actually
ever challenges

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:15.768
Escobar's leadership.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:44.097
Planes would leave the
jungle drug laboratories,

00:02:44.163 --> 00:02:47.100
laden with cocaine,
and begin to fly

00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:52.338
northwards and hopscotch
across the Caribbean

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:53.840
before it hit US shores.

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:07.287
CARLTON TURNER: And that
was all coming in to Miami.

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:09.522
So Miami was a
distribution point.

00:03:09.589 --> 00:03:10.590
And Miami became a hotbed of
corruption, of the cartels.

